    "title": "GATEWAY-batchinsertion-List Weather Alerts Settings-v5-spec",
    "description": "The Weather Alerts Settings API provides access to the configuration settings for weather alerts. Users can retrieve current settings that define how alerts are managed and delivered for severe weather events. This endpoint is particularly beneficial for service providers and application developers who need to monitor and customize alert notifications based on user preferences. Typical use cases include integrating weather alerts in mobile applications and configuring automated responses based on weather conditions.",
